xdg-desktop-portal-gtk4 (1.6.5-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial packaging.
    - Built from cargo with vendored dependencies (--locked --offline) and
      installed via `make install` to place the portal binary and data files.
    - Provides an xdg-desktop-portal backend implementation using GTK4.

